workloads of various SRE teams?

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:30.280
DAVE RENSIN: OK, so there are
some good rule of thumb limits

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:32.470
about the number of
incidents you can really

00:03:32.470 --> 00:03:36.280
have during an on call period
or how much of your project time

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:36.920
